email_from.description:
The `[mailbox.<name>]` account whose `SMTP` half delivers `OTP` codes and
password-reset links. Required whenever `otp` or `password` is enabled;
naming a mailbox with no `[mailbox.<name>.smtp]` section refuses to boot.

transport.description:
How every sign-in this server serves hands its session to the client.
[`SessionTransport::Json`], the default, puts the tokens in the response body;
[`SessionTransport::Cookie`] puts them in `HttpOnly` cookies instead.
